  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[mocha](https://www.npmjs.com/package/mocha) just published its new version 3.0.1.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      mocha\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      3.0.1\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs mocha is “only” a devDependency of this project it **might not break production or downstream projects**, but “only” your build or test tools – **preventing new deploys or publishes**.\n\nI recommend you give this issue a high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 5 commits .\n- [`6a401c7`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/6a401c74c8f990e9c9d74e826bb56c449e1c1c3b) <code>Release v3.0.1</code>\n- [`3b967ba`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/3b967baa7585f9815c25412e335815cd954ebda9) <code>update CHANGELOG.md; rebuild [ci skip]</code>\n- [`8afe661`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/8afe66169f4fe89124c1785c3f029fd3d4f1dcb9) <code>Merge pull request #2411 from not-an-aardvark/2406-nested-describe-only</code>\n- [`8cae7a3`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/8cae7a34f0b6eafeb16567beb8852b827cc5956b) <code>fix nested describe.only suites; closes #2406</code>\n- [`4ad372b`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/4ad372b9850d29ec8f65567b1a1f257943deb5a6) <code>update date in CHANGELOG.md [ci skip]</code>\n\nSee the [full diff](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/compare/e8cda7399efe1f8f1da97d8295ad323f9c64c8aa...6a401c74c8f990e9c9d74e826bb56c449e1c1c3b).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
